Change to OCCT (V8_0_1) for the Open CAD Viewer. Applied by wasm/scripts/build-occt.sh after
occt-step-draughting-models.patch, which changes the same file.

- STEP AP203 e2: read ELEMENTARY_BREP_SHAPE_REPRESENTATION (short name EBSR, conformance option
  co28) as the SHAPE_REPRESENTATION it specialises. OCCT did not know the type, so parts using it
  loaded empty and the transfer failed. Its items are ordinary MANIFOLD_SOLID_BREPs.

